WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.600
Hello, I'm Bookie, KnowAll's bookkeeper.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.600
I keep an eye on your books in Xero and Business Central,
every client, one sign-in.

3
00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:15.600
Ask me who owes you, what's due,
or how cash looks next quarter,

4
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.800
and I'll check the real figures, not guesses.

5
00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:22.200
I'm open source, I never store your accounts,

6
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:24.700
and I'm happy to join your Teams calls.

7
00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:27.300
Shall we have a look?
